<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 284-7 IN 50 OVERS V AUSTRALIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 284-7 IN 50 OVERS V AUSTRALIA.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa scored 284 for seven off their 50 overs in the sixth one day international against Australia at Centurion Park on Thursday.</p>
</text>
